      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get that it might be a virus but it feels so much worse than a normal cold. my throat is so swollen i'm actually having a little trouble catching my breath sometimes... and i've started feeling really shaky and like my heart is skipping beats too. wouldn't it be better to just take the cipro now just in case it IS bacterial, rather than waiting a few days and having it get even crazier? i really can't afford a doctor right now so i'm trying to be proactive.",
